  "description": "Yoo Sera and Ji Yoon-jae were childhood neighbors who shared a sibling-like bond. After Yoon-jae moved away and lost contact, the two reunited as neighbors once they reached adulthood. Their joyful reunion is short-lived, however, as Yoon-jae witnesses Sera's fiancé cheating on her just before their wedding. In an attempt to break the news, Yoon-jae ends up spending a passionate night with a drunken Sera... \n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14350985), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/noona_dont_marry), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000081106)",
